{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39759","headline":"寄献梓橦山侯侍御 · 黄滔","name":"寄献梓橦山侯侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉宫行庙略，簪笏落民间。\n直道三湘水，高情四皓山。\n赐衣僧脱去，奏表主批还。\n地得松萝坞，泉通雨雪湾。\n东门添故事，南省缺新班。\n片石秋从露，幽窗夜不关。\n梦余蟾隐映，吟次鸟绵蛮。\n可惜相如作，当时事悉闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}